description:
Extend the switch in render_uncompute (transpiler/src/uncompute_pass.cpp:37-85) with 4 new cases. Each emits one line of injected inverse: ADD_ASSIGN_CONST emits '    <result> -= <operands[0].name>;
', SUB_ASSIGN_CONST emits '    <result> += ...;
', MUL_ASSIGN_CONST emits '    <result> /= ...;
', DIV_ASSIGN_CONST emits '    <result> *= ...;
'. The operand's .name holds the verbatim RHS source text from Lexer::getSourceText (populated by Issue PB-matchers). Indentation matches Phase A precedent (4 spaces).
